@details
1 | description |
  Add new variants (Settings, Skills, Scud, Transcripts) to the ViewMode enum in main.rs to support all 7 view tabs. Update any related pattern matching in the file.
2 | description |
  Add new fields to AppState in state.rs for configuration, skills, SCUD tasks, transcripts, and swarm execution state. Include all specified structs like SkillInfo, TaskDetail, TranscriptInfo, and ValidationResult.
2.1 | description |
  Define new structs SkillInfo, SkillVariable, TaskDetail, TranscriptInfo, ValidationResult, and SettingsState in state.rs with all required fields per PRD Phase 3.2 including SCUD, harness, execution, guidance, and backpressure configuration fields.
2.2 | description |
  Add new fields to AppState including: config, config_dirty, skills, selected_skill, skill_args, scud_tags, active_tag, tasks, selected_task, transcripts, selected_transcript, transcript_content, transcript_search, prd_file, swarm_running, current_wave, current_round, validation_results, and settings (SettingsState).
3 | description |
  Move the view_waves logic from main.rs into a new views/waves.rs file. Implement the full function with wave visualization, task buttons, and controls, using the updated AppState.
3.1 | description |
  Create a new file views/waves.rs and move the basic view_waves function structure from main.rs, including function signature and initial setup, ensuring it compiles without the full implementation.
3.2 | description |
  Complete the view_waves function in views/waves.rs by implementing the wave visualization logic, task buttons, and controls, integrating with the updated AppState.
4 | description |
  Move the view_agents logic from main.rs into views/agents.rs. Include agent status display, validation results, and controls for pause/resume/cancel.
5 | description |
  Move the view_output logic from main.rs into views/output.rs. Implement output buffer display with clear and copy buttons.
6 | description |
  Create views/settings.rs with placeholder view function. This stub will be replaced with full Settings implementation in Phase 3 covering SCUD tag selection, harness/model config, execution settings, guidance fields, and backpressure configuration.
7 | description |
  Create views/skills.rs with placeholder view function. This stub will be replaced with full Skills implementation in Phase 4 including skills browser with listing, detail view, variable input, and execution via SkillRegistry.
8 | description |
  Create views/scud.rs with placeholder view function. This stub will be replaced with full SCUD management in Phase 5 including task list, status editing, tag management, and PRD import functionality.
9 | description |
  Create views/transcripts.rs with placeholder view function. This stub will be replaced with full Transcripts browser in Phase 6 including search, list panel, detail viewer with content display, and replay functionality.
10 | description |
  Add all new view modules to views/mod.rs with pub mod declarations. Refactor main.rs to use the extracted view functions, update navigation, and remove inlined view logic while maintaining all functionality.
10.1 | description |
  Add pub mod declarations for all new view modules in views/mod.rs to make them accessible.
10.2 | description |
  Update main.rs to import and use the extracted view functions, update navigation logic for all 7 views, and remove all inlined view logic while ensuring all functionality is maintained. This is critical for Phase 1 completion.
